From: Indr1d-C0ld <102763446+Indr1d-C0ld@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:26:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/14] SAGA2: Add the automated test scenarios of the
 melchior-fta2 restoration

collaudoTick() runs only when the game configuration has the key
melchior_collaudo (quest, salva or giro). It checks the restored quests
and fixes, their persistence across a save, and wanders the world
looking for crashes, reporting with COLLAUDO lines and then quitting.
Driven by tools/collaudo.sh in the restoration project.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 engines/saga2/collaudo.cpp | 333 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 engines/saga2/collaudo.h   |  33 ++++
 engines/saga2/main.cpp     |   4 +
 engines/saga2/module.mk    |   1 +
 4 files changed, 371 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 engines/saga2/collaudo.cpp
 create mode 100644 engines/saga2/collaudo.h

diff --git a/engines/saga2/collaudo.cpp b/engines/saga2/collaudo.cpp
